OL,3,GNEWSACare homes with bars - coping with
OL,4,Aan ageing prison population
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn one of Scotland's largest prisons a
OL,7,Funique experiment is taking place in an
OL,8,Farea called The Basement.
OL,10,FAside from having lost their liberty
OL,11,Fthrough crime, the inmates who gather
OL,12,Fthere for meetings at HMP Edinburgh all
OL,13,Fhave something in common. They are
OL,14,Fgetting old.
OL,16,FSome of them are displaying symptoms of
OL,17,Fdementia, while others are simply using
OL,18,Fthe facility because it offers the
OL,19,Fcompany of men from a similar
OL,20,Fgeneration.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
