OL,3,GNEWSACare homes with bars - coping with
OL,4,Aan ageing prison population
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor the prison staff who run the
OL,7,Fmeetings, they offer an alternative way
OL,8,Fof looking after prisoners with needs
OL,9,Fsuch as frailty or social isolation
OL,10,Fthat are hard to meet within a prison
OL,11,Fsetting.
